cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: pose-estimate
abstract: 'Markerless pose estimation from video with DeepLabCut 3 (Mathis labs): SuperAnimal pretrained models (TopViewMouse,
  Quadruped; Ye et al. 2024), zero-shot or adapted to the video, or a lab''s own DeepLabCut model; video probing, trimming
  and cropping; pose on the session clock in NWB (ndx-pose) and DeepLabCut format; QC clip and confidence figures; agreement
  with a pose already in the session NWB. Pennsieve packages these methods and did not develop them. Part of the Pennsieve
  Markerless Behaviour workflow.'
